---
Show inference progress (analyzed files, gaps, stale entries)

Usage: specforge infer-status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

      --gaps
          Show unanalyzed files grouped by directory

      --stale
          Show stale and deleted files

      --gaps-detail
          Show detailed gap analysis (public item facts no entity cites)

  -h, --help
          Print help
